<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT KARNATAKA BY 244 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT KARNATAKA BY 244 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>COCHIN, India 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat India's</p>
<p>Ranji Trophy champions Karnataka by 244 runs on the final day of</p>
<p>their three-day match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 243 and 233; Karnataka 115 and 117.</p>
